         toggle, and reviewed by Play Store: must stay precise and
         truthful about exactly what this does and nothing more. -->
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Lets VoxScribe\'s floating bubble (an alternative to switching keyboards) detect which text field is focused and insert your dictated text into it directly. VoxScribe does not read, log, or transmit anything else you type.</string>

